WEBVTT

01:32.370 --> 01:33.730
Are you okay?

01:34.890 --> 01:38.700
How could a gust of wind 
be so powerful? Man...

01:41.370 --> 01:43.900
Let's find a spot to hide.

01:48.430 --> 01:52.240
I'm surprised you're still conscious 
after you got slammed like that.

01:53.800 --> 01:56.040
I'm built tough.

01:56.340 --> 02:00.300
Thank goodness my Bracelet 
of Hermes didn't go off.

02:01.160 --> 02:03.270
It's because my plan failed.

02:03.270 --> 02:04.250
Sorry.

02:04.480 --> 02:06.540
Nah, we almost had it.

02:06.540 --> 02:08.340
It was working in the beginning.

02:08.340 --> 02:10.230
Poison magic works on it.

02:11.000 --> 02:15.190
Even if it does, it's going to need 
an order of magnitude more.

02:15.190 --> 02:16.140
Then...

02:16.690 --> 02:20.290
we just need to make an 
order of magnitude more.

02:20.290 --> 02:22.430
What? How?

02:22.430 --> 02:25.750
Remember what we learned in 
Professor Claude's lecture yesterday?

02:28.690 --> 02:31.370
Cross Magic...

02:31.370 --> 02:32.670
Yep.

02:32.670 --> 02:36.190
Your magic combined with mine

02:36.190 --> 02:39.350
might make some really 
powerful poison magic.

02:41.350 --> 02:46.510
We can infuse this bulb with 
Scorpion Magic and Virgo Magic

02:46.510 --> 02:48.640
to make a new kind of flower.

02:48.640 --> 02:50.140
That's too dangerous!

02:52.770 --> 02:57.280
If we fail, you might end 
up poisoned yourself.

02:58.740 --> 03:01.890
I can't do that.

03:02.460 --> 03:04.300
I'll be fine.

03:04.950 --> 03:07.330
You don't know that!

03:07.720 --> 03:11.770
You know how to use so many 
different kinds of magic.

03:11.770 --> 03:13.370
That's how I know.

03:14.660 --> 03:20.070
It took me such a long time 
just to get used to using Anima.

03:20.070 --> 03:26.490
It just shows how much effort you put 
into confronting your own magic.

03:27.130 --> 03:30.780
That's why I'm sure it'll work out.

03:32.820 --> 03:37.040
Confronting my own magic, huh?

03:52.470 --> 03:53.730
We're doing this.

03:56.430 --> 03:57.250
Okay.

04:00.980 --> 04:02.430
Virgo Magic.

04:02.950 --> 04:04.910
Scorpion Magic.

04:05.820 --> 04:07.200
I don't need to worry.

04:07.200 --> 04:11.810
I'm not the same person I was when 
I couldn't control my powers.

04:11.810 --> 04:16.040
I need to trust myself and 
manipulate the poison!

04:19.600 --> 04:20.880
It worked!

04:22.730 --> 04:24.300
Take this!

04:35.880 --> 04:37.250
It's so pretty...

04:37.600 --> 04:39.640
A poison flower.

04:42.460 --> 04:45.940
It keeps producing poison 
so long as it's blooming.

04:46.180 --> 04:49.390
But I'm not sure it's any different 
from my own individual attack...

04:53.670 --> 04:55.640
I don't think one is going to cut it.

04:55.900 --> 04:58.710
If we only have one, 
we can just make more.

05:05.800 --> 05:08.740
I can use Anima to propagate more flowers!

05:16.690 --> 05:18.400
Efflorescent Equinox!

05:21.820 --> 05:23.000
It worked.

05:23.290 --> 05:25.260
We won!

05:25.980 --> 05:27.940
I don't believe it.

05:27.940 --> 05:30.930
We actually took it down.

05:31.220 --> 05:34.480
I told you it would work out.

05:35.850 --> 05:39.170
I think we might make a pretty good team!

05:42.810 --> 05:45.570
Yes, I think you're right.

05:50.830 --> 05:53.880
Libra Magic: Psychic!

05:54.570 --> 05:57.130
Castor, watch for an 
attack from the right!

05:59.710 --> 06:02.420
I don't need your power!

06:02.420 --> 06:03.670
Quit telling me what to do!

06:03.670 --> 06:06.670
What? Who said you could 
talk to me like that?

06:06.670 --> 06:09.550
Come on, you guys have to cooperate.

06:14.340 --> 06:15.480
Sorry!

06:15.480 --> 06:16.470
Do me next!

06:17.970 --> 06:20.730
Gemini Magic: Aglaea!

06:25.040 --> 06:26.110
Isn't that...

06:26.110 --> 06:27.840
Pollux!

06:28.310 --> 06:31.160
Big Bro really isn't 
a team player, is he?

06:31.160 --> 06:33.200
That's why he can't make any friends.

06:33.930 --> 06:36.400
Follow me, guys.

06:36.810 --> 06:38.280
I'll take you to victory.

06:44.400 --> 06:47.680
Looks like they've been 
stealing from a lot of people.

06:48.360 --> 06:50.640
No time to stand here being amazed.

06:51.520 --> 06:55.310
We need to be back before sundown, 
or we'll be disqualified.

06:58.020 --> 06:59.340
What's wrong?

06:59.340 --> 07:01.470
My magic power's all spent.

07:01.470 --> 07:03.860
Is it backlash from using 
such powerful magic?

07:04.500 --> 07:08.440
I'm going to take a short break.

07:08.680 --> 07:09.820
Are you all right?

07:10.260 --> 07:11.860
I'm fine.

07:11.860 --> 07:13.620
I'll see you up ahead.

07:14.870 --> 07:16.370
All right.

07:16.370 --> 07:18.390
You'd better catch up to me.

07:21.000 --> 07:23.460
Th-Thank goodness.

07:23.460 --> 07:25.840
I didn't want to hold her back.

07:27.750 --> 07:31.930
I'll be... right...

07:38.620 --> 07:40.230
It's sundown.

07:41.520 --> 07:43.130
It's about time.

07:44.880 --> 07:46.060
Just a little longer.

07:46.470 --> 07:48.030
Did you say something?

07:48.580 --> 07:49.590
No.

07:50.270 --> 07:51.730
It's nothing.

07:55.820 --> 07:57.600
How are you doing?

07:57.600 --> 07:58.620
Huh?

07:58.620 --> 08:00.620
Why are you here?

08:00.620 --> 08:02.740
Wait, was I sleeping?!

08:02.740 --> 08:03.830
For about an hour.

08:03.830 --> 08:06.740
Oh, no! We have to get to the goal!

08:06.740 --> 08:07.900
Don't bother.

08:08.990 --> 08:11.590
The bracelets just glowed red.

08:11.590 --> 08:14.100
That means the exam's over.

08:14.510 --> 08:16.650
We're disqualified.

08:18.560 --> 08:20.110
No...

08:20.610 --> 08:22.710
Disqualified?!

08:23.390 --> 08:25.000
It's a shame.

08:25.900 --> 08:28.690
Why didn't you leave me behind?

08:28.690 --> 08:31.160
I saw you collapse.

08:31.160 --> 08:35.650
I wouldn't be able to live with myself
if it was because of my poison.

08:35.650 --> 08:38.380
It had nothing to do with the magic.

08:38.380 --> 08:41.740
But you're disqualified because of me.

08:41.740 --> 08:43.000
No kidding.

08:43.000 --> 08:46.200
I promised my parents I'd get first place.

08:46.980 --> 08:48.330
Sorry!

08:48.570 --> 08:50.090
I'm kidding.

08:50.090 --> 08:54.800
I was only fixated on being first because 
I didn't have confidence in myself.

08:55.060 --> 08:58.560
I just wanted a title 
that I could be proud of.

08:58.930 --> 09:01.660
But it doesn't matter anymore.

09:01.660 --> 09:06.270
I got something I wanted even more.

09:06.580 --> 09:08.480
Something you wanted?

09:08.900 --> 09:10.370
Never mind.

09:17.210 --> 09:19.120
Welcome back, Spica.

09:19.120 --> 09:21.020
Yeesh, you're late.

09:21.020 --> 09:22.660
Were you taking a nap or something?

09:22.660 --> 09:24.200
Uh-huh.

09:24.200 --> 09:26.400
I got so tired that I conked out.

09:26.400 --> 09:27.730
For real?

09:27.730 --> 09:29.070
You're kinda my hero.

09:29.070 --> 09:30.540
Did you all pass?

09:30.540 --> 09:33.470
Yeah, thanks to Pollux.

09:33.470 --> 09:35.170
As for me...

09:37.760 --> 09:40.130
How do we defeat this thing?!

09:40.130 --> 09:43.150
We just need to become friends!

09:43.720 --> 09:48.640
Dance to the rhythm, and we'll be friends!

09:51.390 --> 09:56.950
Even the obstacles you can't 
overcome by yourself

09:56.950 --> 10:01.910
are no big deal if you have your friends.

10:03.240 --> 10:06.590
This is hilarious. 
My body's moving on its own!

10:07.910 --> 10:10.520
We're all friends!

10:11.620 --> 10:13.090
Now!

10:15.750 --> 10:18.000
My friends!

10:18.000 --> 10:20.270
I worked with Merrow.

10:20.270 --> 10:21.880
Easy win.

10:21.880 --> 10:23.700
I knew you'd pull it off.

10:23.700 --> 10:26.630
Oh, I'm going to report to the professor.

10:26.930 --> 10:28.530
Spica...

10:34.130 --> 10:38.360
Professor, um... I'm sorry.

10:38.690 --> 10:43.830
I said I was going to make it to the top 
of the coven, but I didn't even get close.

10:43.830 --> 10:48.180
Man, I had no idea Cross Magic 
would consume so much power.

10:48.180 --> 10:51.330
We got so close, too.

10:54.070 --> 10:57.500
Although I also messed up a lot.

11:00.100 --> 11:04.170
I couldn't take the gryphon 
down on my own, either.

11:04.610 --> 11:07.740
Even after all the time you 
spent coaching me every day...

11:08.430 --> 11:09.560
I'm so...

11:11.370 --> 11:14.760
You must be so disappointed 
to have me as an apprentice.

11:17.170 --> 11:18.910
I'm sorry.

11:20.120 --> 11:22.000
I hate this.

11:22.650 --> 11:27.110
I never would have thought letting 
him down would be so frustrating.

11:27.700 --> 11:29.700
It doesn't matter how hard I try

11:30.900 --> 11:32.880
if I can't make anything of it.

11:34.170 --> 11:35.490
Are you crying?

11:36.620 --> 11:40.910
P-Professor, you have zero tact.

11:40.910 --> 11:42.830
I don't even know why I'm crying anymore.

11:43.300 --> 11:44.730
Oh, sorry.

11:45.090 --> 11:47.560
You're right. There was a 
lot of room for improvement.

11:47.560 --> 11:50.230
But not all of it was a failure.

11:52.060 --> 11:55.800
You were at odds with 
Sasorijo in the beginning.

11:55.800 --> 11:58.260
But you overcame that, worked together,

11:58.790 --> 12:04.050
brought out each other's power, and 
defeated the enemy in spectacular fashion.

12:05.850 --> 12:08.140
You've really grown, Spica.

12:08.890 --> 12:10.300
Be proud of yourself.

12:13.040 --> 12:14.340
I will!

12:16.510 --> 12:20.550
Professor Claude gives off 
a different aura as of late.

12:20.800 --> 12:22.240
He does.

12:22.640 --> 12:26.180
He used to keep his 
students at arm's length.

12:26.670 --> 12:31.020
I'd never seen him look so defeated.

12:31.940 --> 12:33.100
Just a little longer.

12:33.970 --> 12:35.080
No.

12:35.080 --> 12:36.420
It's nothing.

12:36.890 --> 12:41.650
Perhaps he's changing as a teacher, too.

12:42.190 --> 12:45.990
You'll flunk if you fail the final, too.

12:47.990 --> 12:50.590
Your training will be even 
more intense going forward.

12:50.590 --> 12:51.740
Prepare yourself.

12:52.410 --> 12:53.830
I'll do my best.

13:02.210 --> 13:03.800
I'm handing out the exam results.

13:06.310 --> 13:09.630
I knew it was coming, but F-rank...

13:09.630 --> 13:11.650
Those of you who passed,

13:11.650 --> 13:15.300
continue to put in the work to 
improve your final exam grade.

13:15.740 --> 13:20.900
And those of you who failed: 
Chiron Sagittarius, Tarf Cancer,

13:20.900 --> 13:25.820
Ewe Aries, Hana Sasorijo, 
and Spica Virgo...

13:26.120 --> 13:31.470
I'll have you attend the winter 
remedial camp a week from now.

13:31.470 --> 13:32.750
Camp?

13:33.010 --> 13:38.160
In the magic mountains where the founding 
witch, Selene, is said to have trained.

13:38.160 --> 13:41.750
You'll work on your magic abilities 
for three days, from dawn till dusk.

13:41.750 --> 13:43.960
Dawn till dusk?

13:44.410 --> 13:48.460
Countless students each year 
attempt to flee screaming.

13:48.460 --> 13:50.240
It's a hellish training camp.

13:50.630 --> 13:53.810
But I won't allow a single deserter.

13:53.810 --> 13:57.140
I expect all of you to see 
it through to the end.

13:57.140 --> 14:00.670
I don't want to go to this camp!

14:00.670 --> 14:02.660
Students who passed 
are free to join, as well.

14:02.660 --> 14:04.190
Give it some thought.

14:04.540 --> 14:06.910
It's all good, Spica.

14:06.910 --> 14:08.980
Maybe I'll go mess with you at the camp.

14:08.980 --> 14:11.860
Shush! Go away! A-rankers 
don't get to come!

14:12.340 --> 14:15.440
Us F-rankers are going to 
enjoy the camp by ourselves.

14:16.270 --> 14:17.740
Right, Hana?

14:17.980 --> 14:19.930
Hana...

14:19.930 --> 14:23.200
Oh, sorry. "Sasorijo" is just so long.

14:23.450 --> 14:24.630
Whatever.

14:24.630 --> 14:26.200
Call me what you like.

14:26.670 --> 14:31.640
THIMP-THUMP

14:27.060 --> 14:31.250
No one's ever called me 
Hana outside of my family.

14:31.630 --> 14:34.150
When did you two get so close?

14:34.550 --> 14:36.650
It's like we're friends.

14:36.650 --> 14:38.310
Hey, Hana!

14:38.310 --> 14:40.580
We're gonna need some 
supplies for the camp.

14:40.580 --> 14:42.060
Wanna go hang out in town?

14:42.380 --> 14:43.750
Shopping?!

14:43.750 --> 14:46.410
It's really like we're friends!

14:47.300 --> 14:49.370
Would that bother you?

14:49.600 --> 14:50.590
Sure, fine.

14:50.590 --> 14:53.450
Spi—Virgo.

14:53.450 --> 14:55.320
Yay!

14:55.320 --> 14:57.190
Aw, I wanna go, too.

14:57.190 --> 14:58.460
That sounds fun.

14:58.460 --> 15:00.960
Why don't we all go together?

15:01.260 --> 15:03.950
I couldn't call her by her first name.

15:03.950 --> 15:06.550
After all the nasty things I said to her,

15:06.550 --> 15:09.740
I can't just switch to talking 
to her like we're friends.

15:10.350 --> 15:13.510
I'd never join you.

15:13.870 --> 15:17.940
I've been keeping my distance 
from people for so long.

15:17.940 --> 15:19.720
This is too much for me.

15:19.720 --> 15:22.560
Hana, can the four of us go together?

15:23.310 --> 15:24.690
You're good, right?

15:24.690 --> 15:27.200
It isn't just the two of us?!

15:27.200 --> 15:29.910
And it's with these 
two social butterflies?

15:29.910 --> 15:33.250
M-My tummy's starting to hurt.

15:38.180 --> 15:39.750
I don't know...

15:40.780 --> 15:44.780
What am I supposed to wear when 
I go out with other people?

15:44.780 --> 15:49.700
I've never even spoken with 
Aquarius or Taurus before.

15:49.700 --> 15:52.120
I feel so tense.

15:52.120 --> 15:53.100
But...

15:56.360 --> 15:59.930
It'd be nice if I could 
become friends with them.

16:04.260 --> 16:06.700
I haven't hit the town in a while.

16:06.700 --> 16:07.740
Where should we go?

16:07.740 --> 16:09.890
I'd like to have something good to eat.

16:09.890 --> 16:13.630
I'm really here to go 
shopping with the others.

16:13.630 --> 16:16.360
I hope I'm not dressed awkwardly.

16:17.310 --> 16:21.530
Aquarius's outfit is so frilly and cute.

16:21.530 --> 16:24.050
I wouldn't look good 
in anything like that.

16:24.050 --> 16:26.110
Am I being glared at?

16:26.110 --> 16:27.450
Did I do something?

16:27.450 --> 16:30.320
No, I was just looking at your clothes.

16:30.320 --> 16:32.460
I've messed up already!

16:32.460 --> 16:34.050
I need to be careful.

16:34.050 --> 16:37.280
You were at Diana for middle 
school, right, Hana?

16:37.280 --> 16:39.020
I was, too.

16:39.020 --> 16:40.920
Oh, I see.

16:41.360 --> 16:44.070
I killed the conversation!

16:44.070 --> 16:45.810
Well, wanna get going?

16:46.040 --> 16:47.610
I want ice cream.

16:47.610 --> 16:50.200
I like that ice cream shop over there!

16:50.190 --> 17:05.910
SPIRALING

16:50.200 --> 16:53.250
I don't know how to carry on a 
conversation when people talk to me.

16:53.250 --> 16:54.600
Oh, maybe I should have said,

16:54.600 --> 16:57.190
"We never got to talk since 
we were in different covens."

16:57.190 --> 17:00.690
But what if I reply and 
she thinks I'm boring?

17:00.690 --> 17:04.130
I have no idea how to keep people 
engaged! This is so hard!

17:04.130 --> 17:05.910
Harder than the exam!

17:06.800 --> 17:08.010
I'm screwed.

17:08.010 --> 17:10.710
I think they all hate me.

17:10.710 --> 17:15.770
I've never cared what anyone 
thought of me until now.

17:19.190 --> 17:20.510
"Aiee!"

17:20.510 --> 17:23.140
I didn't know you could make 
such cute noises, Hana.

17:23.140 --> 17:25.600
D-Don't mock me, Virgo!

17:25.600 --> 17:27.030
My bad.

17:27.030 --> 17:29.180
It's just that you looked 
really intense there.

17:29.180 --> 17:31.770
Try to loosen up, yeah?

17:31.770 --> 17:33.330
Here. Ice cream.

17:40.670 --> 17:42.480
I wanna check out the boutique.

17:45.050 --> 17:47.730
It says it's a magic mirror.

17:47.730 --> 17:50.920
It displays whatever you 
picture in your mind.

17:50.920 --> 17:52.220
Huh.

17:52.220 --> 17:53.890
I guess it's a light magic thing?

17:53.890 --> 17:55.770
That sounds fun!

17:57.080 --> 17:58.980
Spica the dancer!

18:00.800 --> 18:02.570
Io the bunny!

18:04.010 --> 18:05.050
Hana, you're next!

18:05.050 --> 18:06.870
I-I'm not cut out for this!

18:06.870 --> 18:08.950
Relax. I got this.

18:08.950 --> 18:11.030
A pretty princess!

18:10.520 --> 18:11.900
DAZZLE

18:13.010 --> 18:14.300
So cute!

18:14.300 --> 18:15.730
Even her face changed!

18:15.730 --> 18:17.580
Yikes, who is this?

18:17.580 --> 18:19.560
Is this me?

18:19.560 --> 18:21.860
This magic is so fun!

18:21.860 --> 18:23.340
Your turn, Aria!

18:23.570 --> 18:24.820
Next shop!

18:24.820 --> 18:26.880
Hey! No running!

18:27.290 --> 18:29.460
Look, the newest wands.

18:29.460 --> 18:30.450
So pretty.

18:30.450 --> 18:32.620
They're so expensive, though.

18:32.870 --> 18:35.440
Look, mandrake-flavored juice!

18:35.440 --> 18:37.630
Is it really any good?

18:37.630 --> 18:40.570
Rock-paper-scissors to 
see who has to drink it?

18:40.570 --> 18:42.120
One, two...

18:44.210 --> 18:46.160
It tastes like oriental medicine.

18:47.230 --> 18:49.430
Look at the time.

18:50.760 --> 18:53.400
Hey, look, a kitty.

18:53.400 --> 18:55.110
That scared me.

18:55.110 --> 18:57.460
I thought it might be Professor Claude.

19:02.120 --> 19:03.880
That tickles.

19:05.350 --> 19:08.020
Hana, do you like kitties?

19:08.020 --> 19:09.230
I suppose.

19:09.230 --> 19:11.210
I started liking them recently.

19:11.210 --> 19:14.590
Ever since I became fond of a black 
cat that showed up at my dorm.

19:14.590 --> 19:16.830
A black cat in the dorm...

19:17.920 --> 19:20.040
That's Professor Claude!

19:20.470 --> 19:22.260
No way!

19:22.260 --> 19:24.840
Sasorijo nearly kissed me.

19:24.840 --> 19:28.300
W-Were you fond enough of it to kiss it?!

19:28.300 --> 19:33.400
Yes, I tried to, but I can't quite 
recall what happened after that.

19:33.670 --> 19:36.730
So that was when he was in cat form!

19:37.070 --> 19:38.830
I had the wrong idea!

19:38.830 --> 19:40.300
I'm so embarrassed!

19:40.300 --> 19:41.720
Your face is beet red.

19:41.720 --> 19:42.950
What's wrong?

19:42.950 --> 19:45.550
Shut up! It's just the sunset!

19:48.580 --> 19:49.730
What now?

19:49.730 --> 19:51.240
Wanna head back?

19:51.240 --> 19:55.460
Oh, there's one last place I want to go.

19:59.320 --> 20:01.690
The Witch Hat World Tree.

20:03.440 --> 20:06.870
I didn't know you could 
see it from a gondola.

20:06.870 --> 20:09.010
I had no idea this was here.

20:10.640 --> 20:12.760
The view here is amazing.

20:13.670 --> 20:14.680
Look!

20:18.060 --> 20:21.280
Wow, it really is pretty.

20:23.470 --> 20:26.050
I'm glad you seem to be having fun.

20:26.050 --> 20:27.570
Huh? What?

20:27.570 --> 20:31.610
You know, Hana, you seemed 
really distant at first,

20:31.610 --> 20:34.200
but your face is actually 
pretty expressive.

20:34.200 --> 20:36.160
Th-That's not...

20:36.570 --> 20:38.810
Was I that expressive?

20:38.810 --> 20:40.250
That's so embarrassing.

20:40.890 --> 20:41.920
But...

20:42.460 --> 20:44.970
it's true what they say about me.

20:46.020 --> 20:48.520
Hey, that's my house!

20:48.520 --> 20:49.860
Wow!

20:53.810 --> 20:54.670
Io.

20:55.320 --> 20:56.280
Aria.

20:56.690 --> 20:57.920
Spica.

20:59.470 --> 21:01.480
I had fun today.

21:02.160 --> 21:05.360
Thanks for inviting me.

21:08.040 --> 21:10.850
You finally called me by my first name.

21:10.850 --> 21:12.340
Took you long enough.

21:12.340 --> 21:14.320
Say my name again!

21:15.810 --> 21:16.960
I never did.

21:16.960 --> 21:18.680
You totally did!

21:18.680 --> 21:19.910
She's shy.

21:20.540 --> 21:24.740
I'm exhausted after a day of experiencing 
so many things for the first time.

21:25.200 --> 21:28.670
So this is what it means to make friends.

21:29.160 --> 21:30.970
Okay, say cheese.

21:33.390 --> 21:36.240
Hey, it looks like we can get 
our photos taken over there.

21:36.240 --> 21:38.600
I want to get our picture taken, too.

21:38.950 --> 21:41.090
Come on, Hana. You, too.

21:41.970 --> 21:44.980
But this exhaustion...

21:45.840 --> 21:48.000
Say cheese!

21:50.280 --> 21:53.320
...isn't really the bad kind.

23:25.240 --> 23:27.390
Those of us who failed have to go to camp.

23:27.390 --> 23:30.050
But maybe it'll be fun if 
I think of it as a group outing.

23:30.050 --> 23:32.560
Stay strong. We have some 
arduous training coming up.

23:32.560 --> 23:34.070
I don't like arduous work.

23:34.340 --> 23:35.600
You! Ewe! Wake up!

23:35.600 --> 23:37.580
Capella's thighs are so nice.

23:37.140 --> 23:40.000
EPISODE 8
WINTER CAMP BEGINS!!

23:37.580 --> 23:39.750
Next episode: "Winter Camp Begins!!"
